window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Ten Highland warriors. Ten modern time travelers. Ten journeys through time. Can love survive a Scottish medieval war? - For all fans of <i>Outlander</i>!</p> <p>Over 90+ hours of binge-worthy, edge-of-your-seat drama and sizzling highlander romance.</p> <p>Discover the adventures of ten modern people thrown into the 1300's, the midst of Robert the Bruce's Wars of Scottish Independence, and get entangled into the destiny of the Highland Clans Cambel, Mackenzie and MacDonald.</p> <p>Book 1: <i>Highlander's Captive</i> - She's lost in the past. He's a powerful Scottish warrior. Can star-crossed love find a future between the ages?</p> <p>Book 2: <i>Highlander's Secret</i> - He's fighting the demons of his past. She's defending her home and her son. Can two warriors from different centuries find a loving future?</p> <p>Book 3: <i>Highlander's Heart</i> - She's a lost time traveler. He's a haunted Highland hero. Can their romance survive the test of centuries?</p> <p>Book 4: <i>Highlander's Love</i> - She's on the run. He's digging in. When their destinies collide in medieval Scotland, will they forge a love for the ages?</p> <p>Book 5: <i>Highlander's Desire</i> - He's a fierce Highland warrior. She's a struggling history student. Can they transcend the bounds of time to claim the love they desire?</p> <p>Book 6: <i>Highlander's Vow</i> - She's a Highland lady, sworn to become a nun. He's a police detective thrown back in time. Can a vow of love bring them together across centuries?</p> <p>Book 7: <i>Highlander's Bride</i> - Modern medicine keeps her alive, but a medieval Highlander makes her soul sing. Will a diabetic trapped in the past risk her life for a love to span the ages?</p> <p>Book 8: <i>Highlander's Protector</i> - He's trapped in the past. She's trapped in a dungeon. Can they escape their bounds to fight for a forbidden love?</p> <p>Book 9: <i>Highlander's Claim</i> - She must return to the twenty-first century. He's holding her captive. Could her love be the treasure he longs to claim?</p> <p>Book 10: <i>Highlander's Destiny</i> - Fiery passion. Fierce enemies. Forbidden attraction. A modern British spy and a medieval Highlander fight for a shared destiny of love and freedom.</p> <p><i>Called by a Highlander - The Complete Series</i> contains ten steamy audiobooks in which medieval Highlanders and modern-day men and women unite in love and war.</p> <p>If you like fierce warriors, strong heroines, and intoxicating romantic encounters, then you'll adore Mariah Stone's high-drama Highlander series.</p>"; 
